        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chris Tarbell, Ross Ulbricht, Sabu\n- Organizations: FBI, Anonymous\n- Products: Silk Road\n- Roles: special agent, darknet market operator\n- Concepts: Dread Pirate Roberts pseudonym\n\nFacts:\n- Chris Tarbell is a former FBI special agent who infiltrated Anonymous and Silk Road.\n- Chris Tarbell was involved in tracking and arresting Sabu of Anonymous and Ross Ulbricht, who used the pseudonym Dread Pirate Roberts on Silk Road.\n- Ross Ulbricht was born on March 27, 1984.\n- Ross Ulbricht is a former darknet market operator best known for being convicted of creating and running the Silk Road website until his arrest.\n- Ross Ulbricht was known under the pseudonym Dread Pirate Roberts.",
